docs/re/voice-deep.md:22:
docs/re/voice-deep.md:23:## 1. Сигнализация RTC (WebSocket)
docs/re/voice-deep.md:24:
docs/re/voice-deep.md:25:Подключение: `RTCControlSocket` → `wss://c-<region>-<hash>.discord.media:<2053|2096>/` (v=9), TLS ~300 мс.
docs/re/voice-deep.md:26:
docs/re/voice-deep.md:27:| op | направление | содержимое (сжато) |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:28:|---|---|---|
docs/re/voice-deep.md:29:| 8 Hello | in | `{"v":8,"heartbeat_interval":13750}` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:30:| 0 Identify | out | `server_id`, `channel_id`, `user_id`, `session_id`(REDACTED), `token`(REDACTED), `max_dave_protocol_version:1`, `video:true`, `streams:[{type:"video",rid:"100",quality:100}]` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:31:| 1 Select Protocol | out | `protocol:"udp"`, `data:{address,port,mode}`, `codecs:[{name:"opus",type:"audio",priority:1000,payload_type:120},{name:"AV1",type:"video",priority:1000,payload_type:101,...}]` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:32:| 2 Ready | in | `ssrc`(audio), `port`, `ip`, `modes:["aead_aes256_gcm_rtpsize","aead_xchacha20_poly1305_rtpsize"]`, `experiments:["fixed_keyframe..."]`, `streams:[{type:"video",ssrc,rtx_ssrc,rid:"100",quality:100,active:false}]` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:33:| 4 Session Description | in | `mode:"aead_aes256_gcm_rtpsize"`, `secret_key` (32 байта, REDACTED), `media_session_id` (REDACTED), `dave_protocol_version:1`, `secure_frames_version:1`, `audio_codec:"opus"`, `video_codec:"AV1"` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:34:| 15 | in | `{"any":100}` — sink wants (сессия 2); сессия 3 — `{"any":100}` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:35:| 16 | in | `{"voice":"0.22.1+denbeigh.remove-voice-curator-74a3bd0c5","rtc_worker":"1.6.98"}` |
docs/re/voice-deep.md:36:| 3 / 6 | out/in | heartbeat 13 750 мс, ACK (`seq: s`) |
